TITLE Scenario 125: pH=5.0, Metals=Medium, Citrate=50mg/L, Clay, Wet
SOLUTION 1  Multi-metal contaminated soil
    temp      25
    pH        5.0
    pe        3
    units     mol/L
    Pb        4.8263e-04  # 100 mg/L
    Cu        1.2589e-03  # 80 mg/L
    Zn        1.8354e-03  # 120 mg/L
    Ca        1.25e-3
    Mg        8.23e-4
    Na        4.35e-3
    Cl        4.23e-3
    C(4)      1.0e-3
    Citrate   2.6441e-04  # 50 mg/L
    
SURFACE 1  Soil surface sites
    Hfo_wOH   1.5  600  0.09
    -equil 1
    
END
